  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolay Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Title:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Bolay Nutrition Calculator: Calories, Protein &amp; Macros\n     </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Description:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Calculate Bolay calories, protein, carbs, fat, and sodium. Build your Bol with bases, veggies, protein, toppings, and sauces or compare Chef-Inspired Bols.\n     </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.fjwnxldu7d9j\">\n<span>\n     Bolay Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A Bolay meal is built in layers, and every layer changes the final nutrition.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Your choice of rice or noodles, vegetables, protein, toppings, and sauce determines the calories, protein, carbohydrates, fat, and sodium in the finished Bol.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Bolay Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to compare individual ingredients, explore Chef-Inspired Bols, or combine the ingredients from your own order to see the nutrition of the complete meal.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.165poqgr5foq\">\n<span>\n     Build Your Bol From the Base Up\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The easiest way to calculate a customized Bolay order is to follow the same order in which the bowl is built.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Start with your base, then add vegetables, protein, toppings, and sauce.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This matters because a Bol made with jasmine rice, steak, avocado, and a creamy sauce will have a very different nutrition profile from one made with greens, tofu, vegetables, and vinaigrette.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Instead of searching for one average number for \u201cBolay calories,\u201d calculate the ingredients that are actually in your bowl.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.itjsg730vy2z\">\n<span>\n     Your Base Shapes the Carb Profile\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolay offers several very different bases, including options such as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Jasmine Rice\n     <br/>\n     Forbidden Black Rice\n     <br/>\n     Asian Sweet Potato Noodles\n     <br/>\n     Pesto Noodles\n     <br/>\n     Chopped Kale Salad\n     <br/>\n     Spinach and Almond Salad\n     <br/>\n     Naked Artisan Greens\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Rice and noodle bases generally contribute more carbohydrates, while greens-based options create a different calorie and macro balance.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you combine more than one base, include both when calculating your order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.w7k6bqngkg11\">\n<span>\n     Compare Proteins by the Complete Nutrition Profile\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Protein is one of the biggest variables in a Bolay bowl.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Current menu choices include options such as\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Lemon Chicken, Teriyaki Chicken, Rotisserie Chicken Thigh, Garlic Pepper Steak, Miso Glazed Tofu, and Roasted Coho Salmon\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Each contributes a different balance of protein, calories, and fat.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, salmon naturally contains more fat than very lean chicken, while tofu has a different combination of protein, fat, and carbohydrates than meat-based proteins.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the calculator to compare the actual nutrition numbers rather than assuming that every protein serving affects the bowl in the same way.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.n1duxf91adgg\">\n<span>\n     Vegetables Can Add More Than Volume\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolay vegetables include choices such as Garlic Broccoli, Maple Sweet Potatoes, Power Bean Medley, Chilled Street Corn, and Cucumber Tomato Medley.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These ingredients differ nutritionally.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sweet potatoes and corn contribute more carbohydrates than many non-starchy vegetables, while bean-based options can contribute both carbohydrates and protein.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you use several vegetables, add each one to your Bol calculation so the final result reflects your full portion.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.1eniijkbo48t\">\n<span>\n     Toppings and Sauces Finish the Nutrition Too\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     It is easy to calculate the rice and protein but forget what goes on top.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Fresh avocado, feta, Parmesan, almonds, pickled onions, and sauces each add their own nutrition to the bowl.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Sauces such as\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Herb Pesto, Creamy Garlic &amp; Herb, Smoky Chipotle, Ginger Turmeric, and Cilantro Lime Vinaigrette\n    </span>\n<span>\n     can differ substantially in calories, fat, carbohydrates, and sodium.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you use extra sauce or more than one sauce, include that in your total whenever the appropriate portion is available.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.5pznjj9wbpo8\">\n<span>\n     Chef-Inspired Bols vs Build Your Own\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolay also offers complete Chef-Inspired Bols with ingredients already selected for you.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Examples include combinations built around salmon, steak, chicken, tofu, rice, noodles, greens, vegetables, and signature sauces.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you order one of these standard recipes without changes, use the nutrition entry for the complete Chef Bol when available.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you remove ingredients, add extras, or significantly customize the recipe, calculating the individual components can give you a better estimate of the meal you actually receive.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.gfjdmcgadp0a\">\n<span>\n     Bolay Is Gluten-Free, But That Does Not Make Every Bol Nutritionally the Same\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolay states that its menu is\n    </span>\n<span>\n     100% gluten-free\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That is useful information for people avoiding gluten, but gluten-free status does not tell you how many calories, carbs, protein, fat, or sodium a bowl contains.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A rice-based Bol with avocado and sauce can have a very different nutrition profile from a greens-based Bol with chicken and vegetables even though both are gluten-free.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the nutrition values themselves when comparing meals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.lt91xwafl7m8\">\n<span>\n     Calculate the Full Order\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If your order includes more than a Bol, add the other items too.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bolay also offers drinks, sides, and desserts. A lemonade, cookie, chia pudding, or additional side contributes separately to the final nutrition total.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Think of the calculator as:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Bol + side + drink + dessert = complete order\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     This provides more useful information than looking at the main bowl alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.tniec98rcev2\">\n<span>\n     Bolay Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How do I calculate calories in my Bolay bowl?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in a Bolay bowl?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Which Bolay protein has the most protein?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does Bolay sauce add calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Is Bolay gluten-free?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.k4eurx6gsepd\">\n<span>\n     About the Bolay Nutrition Data\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver organizes available\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Bolay nutrition information\n    </span>\n<span>\n     across Chef-Inspired Bols, bases, vegetables, proteins, toppings, sauces, sides, drinks, and desserts.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the ingredient-level calculator to create a closer estimate of a customized Bol or compare standard menu items. Recipes, portions, seasonal items, and menu availability can change, so nutrition data should be reviewed against Bolay's latest published Nutrition and Allergen Guide when updates are released.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "seoTitle": "Bolay Nutrition Calculator: Calories, Protein & Macros",
